The Studio follows the new **editor** role (pipeline PR "Add an editor role"):
- an editor opens every post in review or live, and every draft without an author, ready to edit;
- someone else's draft stays closed to them, as before;
- Delete shows only for the author, a co-author or an admin, so an editor does not see it on someone else's post (the pipeline refuses it too);
- the read-only line now says "Only they, an editor or an admin changes it".

Merge after the pipeline PR. 49/49, build clean.

